@startuml
!include style.puml
hide circle
title Persistent Domain Classes - Actual ORM Structure
class "Django User" as User {
  +id : Integer {framework primary key}
  +username : String {unique}
  +password : String {hashed}
  +is_active : Boolean
  +is_staff : Boolean
  +is_superuser : Boolean
  +last_login : DateTime [0..1]
  +set_password(raw)
  +check_password(raw) : Boolean
}
class Record {
  +id : BigAutoField
  +subject : String {maxLength=150}
  +kind : String {maxLength=16}
  +day : Date
  +values : JSON
  +form_version : String = "legacy"
}
class Activity {
  +id : BigAutoField
  +actor : User
  +event : String {maxLength=32}
  +subject : String = "" {blank allowed, maxLength=150}
  +created : DateTime {auto_now_add}
}
class LoginAttempt {
  +id : BigAutoField
  +username : String {unique, maxLength=150}
  +failures : Integer = 0 {nonnegative}
  +locked_until : DateTime [0..1]
}
class SiteOptions {
  +id : BigAutoField
  +docpup : JSON = {}
  +active_days : Integer = 30
  +session_minutes : Integer = 120
  +login_limit : Integer = 5
  +lock_minutes : Integer = 15
  +selected_models : JSON = {}
  +training_start : Date = 2020-01-01
  +training_validate : Boolean = true
  +source_accounts_loaded : Boolean = false
  +examples_loaded : Boolean = false
}
class Fit {
  +id : BigAutoField
  +kind : String {maxLength=16}
  +start : Date
  +end : Date
  +samples : Integer {nonnegative}
  +artifact : JSON
  +scores : JSON = []
  +created : DateTime {auto_now_add}
  +/available : Boolean {readOnly}
  +/mean_accuracy : Real [0..1] {readOnly}
}
Activity "0..*" --> "1" User : actor\n{FK; on_delete=CASCADE}
Record ..> User : username convention only
LoginAttempt ..> User : username lookup only
SiteOptions ..> Fit : selected_models[kind]\nlogical ID reference
note bottom of Record
  {unique(subject, kind, day)}; index(kind, day)
  Ordered by day DESC, id DESC.
  kind: baseline | hbp | depre | psqi (application catalog).
  No FK to User: identifiers may exist without accounts.
  Record ownership is enforced by request handling.
end note
note bottom of Fit
  kind: hbp | depre | age; ordered by id DESC.
  Source artifact: engine, path, feature_names, form_version,
  classes (classification) OR variance (PCA).
  scores: fold accuracies in percent for the web trainer.
  available: source path exists within BASE_DIR;
  non-source artifacts return true without file checks.
  mean_accuracy = average(scores), or null if empty.
end note
note bottom of SiteOptions
  pk=1 is a singleton convention, not a DB constraint.
  selected_models[kind]: latest (default) | none | Fit ID.
  No database FK or automatic cascade for JSON model IDs.
end note
note bottom of LoginAttempt
  Unknown usernames can also have attempts.
  Time expiry is evaluated on a subsequent login request.
  Administrator password reset deletes the matching attempt.
end note
legend bottom
  Solid arrow with multiplicities: implemented foreign-key association.
  Dashed arrow: dependency / logical lookup, not a foreign key.
  Fields shown for Django User are a relevant subset; portal fields are complete.
endlegend
@enduml
